   PLAYER (e9bd) + read the .FPL (6a9c/612c), then call ec7e (e7c6).  On OK or CANCEL of ec7e -> menu-idle
   (the ec7e-OK tail 6ade write + f338/7088 mission subscreen is a separate deliverable).

